sequenceDiagram
    %% SD2 - Maintain camper and parent records
    %% Stories: 1, 2, 3, 30, 31, 32, 33
    %% Description: The camp administrator adds, modifies and removes campers, keeps records from previous years, and modifies or deletes parents.
    actor AD as Camp administrator
    participant CA as Camper
    participant CM as Camp
    participant GD as Guardian

    %% covers 1
    AD->>CA: add camper
    %% covers 30
    AD->>CA: modify camper information
    %% covers 2, 31
    AD->>CA: remove camper
    %% covers 3
    AD->>CM: keep camper records of previous years
    CM->>CA: past campers
    %% covers 32, 33
    AD->>GD: modify or delete parent
